            {
                "text": "Stringer, Wang, Michaelos and Pachitariu. Cellpose: a generalist algorithm for cellular segmentation. Nature Methods (2021).",
                "doi": "10.1038/s41592-020-01018-x",
                "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41592-020-01018-x"
            },
            {
                "text": "Pachitariu and Stringer. Cellpose 2.0: how to train your own model. Nature Methods (2022).",
